 ('Action and cooperation', ['The developer intends to review actionable abuse reports and, where supported by current app infrastructure, take appropriate account or content actions. Valid requests from authorized authorities may be addressed as required by applicable law.','PROMETEI has multiple network transport modes; not all communications necessarily pass through a centrally moderated service. Users should understand this limitation when reporting or seeking assistance.']),
